    "Rename conda environment:\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda rename --name/-n/—-prefix/-p test123 test321```\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda rename --name test123 test321```\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda rename -p path/to/test123 test321```\n",
    "\n",
    "Params:\n",
    "–n : name of environment\n"
